{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Adult Trajectory Divergence Analysis\n",
    "## Identity Maintenance vs Identity Loss in Layer V ET\n",
    "\n",
    "### Two-Track Analysis:\n",
    "**Track A — Option C (Rough): Aging Drift Analysis**\n",
    "- Uses spinal cord SRR RNA trajectory (single population across time)\n",
    "- Measures how much each gene deviates from expected transcriptional aging drift\n",
    "- Genes changing MORE than average drift = converging toward other cell types\n",
    "- Genes changing LESS than average drift = stably maintained\n",
    "\n",
    "**Track B — Option A (Deep Dive): Multi-Cell-Type Reference**\n",
    "- Uses h5ad adult data as multi-cell-type reference\n",
    "- Computes EDC, Isolation Score, Rank Divergence per gene\n",
    "- Fits early/late slopes to classify trajectory shapes\n",
    "- Assigns Convergence Risk Score (CRS)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Trajectory Shape Classifications:\n",
    "```\n",
    "STABLE_HIGH       → identity maintenance\n",
    "DIVERGING         → identity strengthening with age\n",
    "PROGRESSIVE_LOSS  → gradual identity loss throughout life\n",
    "LATE_LOSS         → maintained in development, lost in aging ← aging vulnerability\n",
    "EARLY_LOSS_RECOV  → transient early loss, recovers\n",
    "STABLE_LOW        → never identity-specific\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import scanpy as sc\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "from scipy.stats import zscore, linregress, spearmanr\n",
    "from scipy.sparse import issparse\n",
    "\n",
    "sc.settings.verbosity = 1\n",
    "pd.set_option('display.max_columns', 20)\n",
    "pd.set_option('display.max_rows', 60)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 0. Configuration"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ── Paths ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "SPINAL_RNA_DIR = Path(\"/home/nakagawa/datasets/aligned_spinalcord/rna\")\n",
    "H5AD_RNA_PATH  = \"/home/nakagawa/datasets/h5ad/SMARTer_cells_MOp.h5ad\"\n",
    "H5AD_CGN_PATH  = \"/home/nakagawa/datasets/h5ad/DNA_Methylation_CGN.h5ad\"\n",
    "H5AD_CHN_PATH  = \"/home/nakagawa/datasets/h5ad/DNA_Methylation_CHN.h5ad\"\n",
    "OUT_DIR        = Path(\"/home/nakagawa/datasets/adult_trajectory_results\")\n",
    "OUT_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Timepoints ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "# Spinal cord RNA timepoints (Option C)\n",
    "SPINAL_TIMEPOINTS = [\"E10.5\", \"E13.5\", \"P4\", \"P13\", \"P21\", \"P56\", \"2yr\"]\n",
    "# Numeric values for slope fitting (days post-conception; E0=0, P0=19)\n",
    "TP_DAYS = {\n",
    "    \"E10.5\": 10.5,\n",
    "    \"E13.5\": 13.5,\n",
    "    \"P4\"   : 23.0,\n",
    "    \"P13\"  : 32.0,\n",
    "    \"P21\"  : 40.0,\n",
    "    \"P56\"  : 75.0,\n",
    "    \"2yr\"  : 749.0,\n",
    "}\n",
    "# Early window = development → young adult; Late window = adult → aged\n",
    "EARLY_WINDOW = [\"E10.5\", \"E13.5\", \"P4\", \"P13\", \"P21\"]\n",
    "LATE_WINDOW  = [\"P21\", \"P56\", \"2yr\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Cell type config (for Option A deep dive) ─────────────────────────────────\n",
    "CT_COL     = \"cell_type\"    # edit after checking h5ad obs columns\n",
    "LAYER_V_ET = \"L5 ET\"        # exact string in h5ad\n",
    "\n",
    "NON_NEURON_TYPES      = [\"Astrocyte\", \"Microglia\", \"Oligodendrocyte\",\n",
    "                          \"OPC\", \"Endothelial\", \"VLMC\"]\n",
    "UPPER_LAYER_TYPES     = [\"L2/3 IT\", \"L4 IT\"]\n",
    "OTHER_DEEP_LAYER_TYPES= [\"L5 IT\", \"L5/6 NP\", \"L6 IT\", \"L6 CT\", \"L6b\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── Thresholds ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "DRIFT_ZSCORE_THRESH = 1.5   # |Z| above this = deviates from average drift\n",
    "SLOPE_THRESH        = 0.01  # slope magnitude below this = 'stable'\n",
    "CRS_THRESH          = 0.5   # |CRS| above this = meaningful convergence/divergence\n",
    "PERCENTILE_THRESH   = 75    # for EDC rank divergence calls\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Configuration set.\")\n",
    "print(f\"Early window : {EARLY_WINDOW}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Late window  : {LATE_WINDOW}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "# TRACK A — Option C: Aging Drift Analysis (Rough)\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1A. Load Spinal Cord RNA Per Timepoint"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def load_star_bulk(tab_path):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Load STAR ReadsPerGene.out.tab. SMARTer Stranded = reverse strand col.\"\"\"\n",
    "    df = pd.read_csv(tab_path, sep=\"\\t\", header=None,\n",
    "                     names=[\"gene\",\"unstranded\",\"forward\",\"reverse\"],\n",
    "                     skiprows=4)\n",
    "    return df.set_index(\"gene\")[\"reverse\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# SRR → timepoint mapping from SraRunTable_(1).csv\n",
    "SRR_TO_TP_SPINAL = {\n",
    "    \"SRR18338966\": \"2yr\",  \"SRR18338967\": \"2yr\",\n",
    "    \"SRR18338968\": \"P56\",  \"SRR18338969\": \"P56\",  \"SRR18338970\": \"P56\",\n",
    "    \"SRR18338971\": \"P21\",  \"SRR18338972\": \"P21\",  \"SRR18338973\": \"P21\",\n",
    "    \"SRR18338974\": \"P13\",  \"SRR18338975\": \"P13\",\n",
    "    \"SRR18338976\": \"P4\",   \"SRR18338977\": \"P4\",   \"SRR18338978\": \"P4\",\n",
    "    \"SRR18338979\": \"E13.5\",\"SRR18338980\": \"E13.5\",\n",
    "    \"SRR18338981\": \"E10.5\",\"SRR18338982\": \"E10.5\",\"SRR18338983\": \"E10.5\",\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Loading spinal cord RNA counts...\")\n",
    "tp_counts = {}   # {timepoint: [Series, ...]}\n",
    "\n",
    "for sample_dir in sorted(SPINAL_RNA_DIR.iterdir()):\n",
    "    if not sample_dir.is_dir(): continue\n",
    "    tab = sample_dir / \"ReadsPerGene.out.tab\"\n",
    "    if not tab.exists(): continue\n",
    "\n",
    "    srr = None\n",
    "    for s in SRR_TO_TP_SPINAL:\n",
    "        if s in sample_dir.name:\n",
    "            srr = s\n",
    "            break\n",
    "    if srr is None:\n",
    "        print(f\"  [SKIP] {sample_dir.name}\")\n",
    "        continue\n",
    "\n",
    "    tp = SRR_TO_TP_SPINAL[srr]\n",
    "    counts = load_star_bulk(tab)\n",
    "    tp_counts.setdefault(tp, []).append(counts)\n",
    "    print(f\"  {sample_dir.name} → {tp}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Average replicates, CPM normalize\n",
    "spinal_cpm = {}\n",
    "for tp, reps in tp_counts.items():\n",
    "    merged      = pd.concat(reps, axis=1).fillna(0).mean(axis=1)\n",
    "    spinal_cpm[tp] = merged / merged.sum() * 1e6\n",
    "\n",
    "spinal_mat = pd.DataFrame(spinal_cpm).fillna(0)   # genes x timepoints\n",
    "print(f\"\\nSpinal RNA matrix: {spinal_mat.shape}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Timepoints loaded: {list(spinal_mat.columns)}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2A. Compute Aging Drift Baseline\n",
    "Average transcriptional change across ALL genes = expected drift.\n",
    "Gene deviating significantly from this = actively regulated, not just drifting."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "available_tp = [t for t in SPINAL_TIMEPOINTS if t in spinal_mat.columns]\n",
    "available_days = [TP_DAYS[t] for t in available_tp]\n",
    "print(f\"Available timepoints: {available_tp}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Log-transform for fold-change interpretation\n",
    "log_mat = np.log1p(spinal_mat[available_tp])\n",
    "\n",
    "# Z-score each gene across timepoints (relative trajectory shape)\n",
    "z_mat = log_mat.apply(zscore, axis=1, result_type='expand')\n",
    "z_mat.columns = available_tp\n",
    "z_mat = z_mat.dropna()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Compute per-timepoint CHANGE relative to first timepoint\n",
    "first_tp = available_tp[0]\n",
    "delta_mat = z_mat.subtract(z_mat[first_tp], axis=0)  # genes x timepoints\n",
    "\n",
    "# Average drift: mean absolute change per timepoint across all genes\n",
    "avg_drift    = delta_mat.abs().mean(axis=0)\n",
    "drift_std    = delta_mat.abs().std(axis=0)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\nAverage transcriptional drift per timepoint (vs first timepoint):\")\n",
    "for tp in available_tp:\n",
    "    print(f\"  {tp:<8}: drift={avg_drift[tp]:.3f}  std={drift_std[tp]:.3f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3A. Fit Trajectory Slopes and Classify Each Gene"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def fit_slope(values, days):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Fit linear slope to values vs days. Returns slope, r², p-value.\"\"\"\n",
    "    if len(values) < 2 or np.std(values) == 0:\n",
    "        return 0.0, 0.0, 1.0\n",
    "    slope, intercept, r, p, se = linregress(days, values)\n",
    "    return slope, r**2, p\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def classify_shape(early_slope, late_slope, thresh=SLOPE_THRESH):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Classify trajectory shape from early and late slopes.\"\"\"\n",
    "    early_dir = \"up\" if early_slope > thresh else (\"down\" if early_slope < -thresh else \"flat\")\n",
    "    late_dir  = \"up\" if late_slope  > thresh else (\"down\" if late_slope  < -thresh else \"flat\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    if   early_dir in [\"up\",\"flat\"] and late_dir in [\"up\",\"flat\"]: return \"STABLE_DIVERGING\"\n",
    "    elif early_dir == \"down\"         and late_dir == \"down\":         return \"PROGRESSIVE_LOSS\"\n",
    "    elif early_dir in [\"up\",\"flat\"] and late_dir == \"down\":         return \"LATE_LOSS\"\n",
    "    elif early_dir == \"down\"         and late_dir in [\"up\",\"flat\"]: return \"EARLY_LOSS_RECOVERED\"\n",
    "    else:                                                             return \"COMPLEX\"\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Fitting trajectory slopes per gene...\")\n",
    "\n",
    "early_days = [TP_DAYS[t] for t in EARLY_WINDOW if t in available_tp]\n",
    "late_days  = [TP_DAYS[t] for t in LATE_WINDOW  if t in available_tp]\n",
    "early_tps  = [t for t in EARLY_WINDOW if t in available_tp]\n",
    "late_tps   = [t for t in LATE_WINDOW  if t in available_tp]\n",
    "\n",
    "rows = []\n",
    "for gene in z_mat.index:\n",
    "    traj = z_mat.loc[gene, available_tp].values\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Full trajectory slope\n",
    "    full_slope, full_r2, full_p = fit_slope(traj, available_days)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Early and late slopes\n",
    "    early_vals = z_mat.loc[gene, early_tps].values\n",
    "    late_vals  = z_mat.loc[gene, late_tps].values\n",
    "    early_slope, early_r2, early_p = fit_slope(early_vals, early_days)\n",
    "    late_slope,  late_r2,  late_p  = fit_slope(late_vals,  late_days)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Drift deviation: how much does this gene deviate from average drift?\n",
    "    gene_delta  = delta_mat.loc[gene, available_tp]\n",
    "    drift_dev   = ((gene_delta.abs() - avg_drift) / (drift_std + 1e-9))\n",
    "    # Positive = changes more than average (converging / drifting)\n",
    "    # Negative = changes less than average (stably maintained)\n",
    "    mean_drift_dev = drift_dev.mean()\n",
    "    late_drift_dev = drift_dev[late_tps].mean() if late_tps else np.nan\n",
    "\n",
    "    shape = classify_shape(early_slope, late_slope)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Total trajectory range (how dynamic this gene is)\n",
    "    traj_range = float(np.max(traj) - np.min(traj))\n",
    "\n",
    "    rows.append({\n",
    "        \"gene\"           : gene,\n",
    "        \"trajectory\"     : \"→\".join(f\"{v:.2f}\" for v in traj),\n",
    "        \"shape\"          : shape,\n",
    "        \"full_slope\"     : round(full_slope,  5),\n",
    "        \"full_r2\"        : round(full_r2,     3),\n",
    "        \"full_p\"         : round(full_p,      5),\n",
    "        \"early_slope\"    : round(early_slope, 5),\n",
    "        \"late_slope\"     : round(late_slope,  5),\n",
    "        \"early_r2\"       : round(early_r2,    3),\n",
    "        \"late_r2\"        : round(late_r2,     3),\n",
    "        \"mean_drift_dev\" : round(mean_drift_dev, 3),\n",
    "        \"late_drift_dev\" : round(late_drift_dev, 3),\n",
    "        \"traj_range\"     : round(traj_range,  3),\n",
    "        **{f\"Z_{tp}\": round(float(z_mat.loc[gene, tp]), 3)\n",
    "           for tp in available_tp}\n",
    "    })\n",
    "\n",
    "drift_df = pd.DataFrame(rows)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\nTrajectory shape distribution:\")\n",
    "print(drift_df[\"shape\"].value_counts().to_string())\n",
    "print(f\"\\nTotal genes analysed: {len(drift_df)}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4A. Save Option C Results"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Save full results\n",
    "drift_df.to_csv(OUT_DIR / \"optionC_aging_drift_all_genes.csv\", index=False)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Save per shape\n",
    "for shape in drift_df[\"shape\"].unique():\n",
    "    sub = drift_df[drift_df[\"shape\"] == shape].copy()\n",
    "    # Sort: most dynamic first (largest traj_range)\n",
    "    sub = sub.sort_values(\"traj_range\", ascending=False)\n",
    "    sub.to_csv(OUT_DIR / f\"optionC_{shape}.csv\", index=False)\n",
    "    print(f\"  {shape}: {len(sub)} genes\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Key lists\n",
    "maintenance = drift_df[\n",
    "    (drift_df[\"shape\"] == \"STABLE_DIVERGING\") &\n",
    "    (drift_df[\"mean_drift_dev\"] < 0)   # changes LESS than average drift\n",
    "].sort_values(\"mean_drift_dev\")\n",
    "\n",
    "aging_vuln = drift_df[\n",
    "    (drift_df[\"shape\"] == \"LATE_LOSS\") &\n",
    "    (drift_df[\"late_drift_dev\"] > DRIFT_ZSCORE_THRESH)  # accelerates in aging\n",
    "].sort_values(\"late_drift_dev\", ascending=False)\n",
    "\n",
    "prog_loss = drift_df[\n",
    "    (drift_df[\"shape\"] == \"PROGRESSIVE_LOSS\") &\n",
    "    (drift_df[\"traj_range\"] > 1.0)   # actually changes substantially\n",
    "].sort_values(\"full_slope\")\n",
    "\n",
    "maintenance.to_csv(OUT_DIR / \"optionC_IDENTITY_MAINTENANCE.csv\",  index=False)\n",
    "aging_vuln.to_csv( OUT_DIR / \"optionC_AGING_VULNERABILITY.csv\",   index=False)\n",
    "prog_loss.to_csv(  OUT_DIR / \"optionC_PROGRESSIVE_LOSS.csv\",      index=False)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\nIdentity maintenance genes : {len(maintenance)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Aging vulnerability genes  : {len(aging_vuln)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Progressive loss genes     : {len(prog_loss)}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5A. Preview Option C Results"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
